# Build output. Nothing in this directory is ever committed.
#
# The installer here is produced from openphantom_installer.iss with Inno Setup, and it belongs
# on a GitHub release as an attached file rather than in the history: a binary in a commit
# outlives the source it was built from, and nobody can tell afterwards which revision made it.
#
# This file is the only thing in here that git tracks, so the directory survives a clone and says
# what it is for.
#
# To fill it, build the extractor first and then the script:
#     cmake -S src/is3_extract -B src/is3_extract/build -A Win32
#     cmake --build src/is3_extract/build --config Release
#     ISCC openphantom_installer.iss

*
!.gitignore
